# Minimal changes

Fix at the narrowest point. Preserve control flow, naming, and patterns in the file you touch.

Do not add new abstractions, test projects, or docs unless the user asks. Match surrounding style.

Pair with `proj-verify-before-infer.mdc` before data-dependent fixes.
